		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead, blood-drinking corpse covered in paper scrolls bearing tattered curses. Scuttles and hops.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 16, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +2 (1d8 + blood drain), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blood Drain</strong>. Vampire heals 1d4 HP, target permanently loses 1 CON. At 0 CON, target dies.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hop</strong>. 1/day, an attack that would hit misses instead.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
